#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, FixPathMtuDiscoveryProblemCheckBox)
#. +> trunk
#: profilenetworkgeneraloptionsbase4.ui:116
msgid ""
"Problem: TCP connections using the PPTP Client host as a hop in the route (such as via normal routing, NAT or IP masquerading) freeze once they attempt to transfer large amounts of data.\n"
"Diagnosis: path MTU discovery may not be working, due to hosts on the route refusing to forward ICMP fragmentation needed responses."
